---
// What is FollowBirds Section
---

<section id="what-is-followbirds" class="what-is-followbirds section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Everything guides and birdwatchers need for a shared tour.</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      Create tours, record sightings, share checklists and keep every observation in a beautiful report.
    </p>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🗺️</div>
        <h3>Tours</h3>
        <p>
          Reusable tour templates and participant invitations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">✓</div>
        <h3>Live Checklists</h3>
        <p>
          Guides record sightings once. Everyone follows the shared list.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">📍</div>
        <h3>Birding Locations</h3>
        <p>
          Use Algarve hotspots, tracks and observation points.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">📄</div>
        <h3>Reports</h3>
        <p>
          Generate web/PDF reports with species, notes, photos and route data.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .what-is-followbirds {
    background-color: #fff;
  }

  .what-is-followbirds h2 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #5E6B60;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid #E8DFD3;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .card:hover {
    border-color: #2F7D32;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(47, 125, 50, 0.08);
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .card h3 {
    color: #142016;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card p {
    color: #5E6B60;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
